{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00004",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.59,
      "end_seconds": 4.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, I couldn't find the door at first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.4,
      "end_seconds": 9.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.09,
      "end_seconds": 20.01,
      "duration_seconds": 9.92,
      "text": "Mainly constipation. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.53,
      "end_seconds": 24.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "On a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.9,
      "end_seconds": 35.78,
      "duration_seconds": 9.88,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly. Oh, and a heavy feeling in the lower tummy. I had hard pellet-like stools before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.24,
      "end_seconds": 51.9,
      "duration_seconds": 12.66,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.31,
      "end_seconds": 54.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.57,
      "end_seconds": 57.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Any abdominal swelling or fever at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.41,
      "end_seconds": 61.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "No abdominal swelling or fever, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.07,
      "end_seconds": 66.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Any pain on passing stool, weight loss or vomiting at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.49,
      "end_seconds": 69.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "No. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.24,
      "end_seconds": 73.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.62,
      "end_seconds": 76.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "No, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 77.88,
      "end_seconds": 88.37,
      "duration_seconds": 10.49,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Temperature is 36.5 degrees, pressure 119 over 76, respiratory rate 16. SpO2 97 percent on room air, pulse 82."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.89,
      "end_seconds": 94.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Good, thank you. Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.82,
      "end_seconds": 103.99,
      "duration_seconds": 9.17,
      "text": "I've got an underactive thyroid. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. Diabetes, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.37,
      "end_seconds": 114.71,
      "duration_seconds": 10.34,
      "text": "Yes, I can see the an underactive thyroid in your file as well. Okay, diabetes, that's already on your record. Good to know. Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.13,
      "end_seconds": 116.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.05,
      "end_seconds": 123.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Right, what medicines do you take regularly? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.86,
      "end_seconds": 128.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Thyroxine, 75 micrograms, every morning for my thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 129.88,
      "end_seconds": 134.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 37.5 micrograms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.18,
      "end_seconds": 138.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Okay. Have you got the newest prescription or the box with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.0,
      "end_seconds": 152.91,
      "duration_seconds": 9.91,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me. Metformin. I take it 500 milligrams, twice a day. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.07,
      "end_seconds": 156.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.84,
      "end_seconds": 159.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.01,
      "end_seconds": 170.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.91,
      "end_seconds": 174.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I have a couple of drinks on the weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.29,
      "end_seconds": 176.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.36,
      "end_seconds": 179.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "I smoke about ten cigarettes a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.06,
      "end_seconds": 184.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Bear with me, I need to finish this line in the notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.65,
      "end_seconds": 204.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Right, carry on. What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.67,
      "end_seconds": 206.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Codeine, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.71,
      "end_seconds": 211.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.47,
      "end_seconds": 212.21,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.96,
      "end_seconds": 229.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.93,
      "end_seconds": 232.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Can I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.31,
      "end_seconds": 235.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.38,
      "end_seconds": 239.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Look straight ahead for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.13,
      "end_seconds": 252.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "I can feel firm stool in the left lower abdomen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.04,
      "end_seconds": 256.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.1,
      "end_seconds": 269.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "There's no mass in the tummy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.94,
      "end_seconds": 281.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.74,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.11,
      "end_seconds": 285.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.65,
      "end_seconds": 299.35,
      "duration_seconds": 12.7,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: My working impression is chronic constipation. I'd also keep haemorrhoids in mind. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had constipation, severe, and no pain on passing stool or vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.49,
      "end_seconds": 302.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.88,
      "end_seconds": 313.99,
      "duration_seconds": 10.11,
      "text": "We should do blood tests for constipation. Let's get a colonoscopy, for constipation and rectal bleeding. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.57,
      "end_seconds": 316.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.62,
      "end_seconds": 324.68,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "I'd like you to take lactulose, 15 ml, at night, for two weeks. You take it by mouth. That's for constipation."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.98,
      "end_seconds": 328.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Okay, so alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.24,
      "end_seconds": 357.81,
      "duration_seconds": 25.57,
      "text": "More fibre, more water, and give yourself ten unhurried minutes after breakfast. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. If you smoke, this is a good moment to think about stopping, and we can help you with that. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 358.43,
      "end_seconds": 359.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.42,
      "end_seconds": 366.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 367.72,
      "end_seconds": 369.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.44,
      "end_seconds": 372.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Let's review you in three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.13,
      "end_seconds": 374.83,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 375.98,
      "end_seconds": 381.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.37,
      "end_seconds": 389.41,
      "duration_seconds": 7.04,
      "text": "So, I take the lactulose, 15 ml, at night and come back in three weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.3,
      "end_seconds": 395.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Good. Call the clinic if you need us in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 395.75,
      "end_seconds": 400.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Okay, you know, thank you. I'll get started on all of that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 401.73,
      "end_seconds": 402.53,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}